Bundled JSON Schemas
====================

Forge bundles the following JSON Schema files for its built-in schema mappings
(crate forge-jsonschema, directory `schemas/`). They are included unmodified.

Written for Forge (MIT, like Forge itself)
------------------------------------------

The Minecraft plugin descriptor schemas, from the Bukkit, Paper, Velocity and BungeeCord
documentation, and the mod metadata schemas, from the Fabric and Mixin documentation:

  minecraft-bukkit-plugin.json    plugin.yml (Bukkit, Spigot, Paper and forks)
  minecraft-paper-plugin.json     paper-plugin.yml
  minecraft-velocity-plugin.json  velocity-plugin.json
  minecraft-bungee-plugin.json    bungee.yml
  minecraft-fabric-mod.json       fabric.mod.json (Fabric mods)
  minecraft-mixins.json           *.mixins.json (Mixin configurations)

The Unity assembly definition schemas, from Unity's manual (Assembly Definition and
Assembly Definition Reference file formats):

  unity-asmdef.json               *.asmdef
  unity-asmref.json               *.asmref

